# Design tokens

`src/app/globle.css` is the only token source. The filename is `globle.css`, not `global.css`.

`--font-size-base` is `1vw` and must stay `1vw`. `html` and `body` must keep `font-size: 1vw !important`. Do not change either one to `rem`, `px`, `100%`, or `var()` if that stops the viewport size from applying. Other type sizes stay `rem` so they scale from that root. This keeps Ctrl +/- from resizing the layout.

- Put colors, type, spacing, radii, shadows, z-index, and motion tokens in `:root`.
- Map the same tokens into Tailwind with `@theme inline` in `globle.css`. Do not introduce a second palette in a Tailwind config.
- Put component and section styles in `src/app/style.css`. Reference tokens. Do not hardcode one-off colors, sizes, or spacing.
- A value used once still gets a named token if it is a brand or layout measurement.

```css
/* ❌ BAD */
.hero__title { color: #ffffff; font-size: 52px; padding: 37px; }

/* ✅ GOOD */
.hero__title {
  color: var(--color-white);
  font-size: var(--font-size-hero);
  padding: var(--space-8);
}
```
